<title>UK: UK enjoying healthy growth, Knight says.</title>
<headline>UK enjoying healthy growth, Knight says.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK economy is enjoying healthy, sustained growth, UK Treasury minister Angela Knight said after today's economic numbers.  </p>
<p>&quot;The figures show healthy and sustainable economic performance,&quot; Knight said in a statement.</p>
<p>DATA SHOWED:</p>
<p>UK Q2 GDP +0.5% QQ, +2.2% YY, EX-OIL GAS +0.5% QQ,+2.1% YY</p>
<p>UK Q2 SAVINGS RATIO 11.1% VS 11.8% Q1, Q2 RPDI +0.1% QQ, +3.3% YY</p>
<p>UK Q2 S/A CURRENT ACCOUNT SURPLUS 457 MLN STG VS 786 MLN DEFICIT IN Q1</p>
